Cybersecurity Approach

My approach to security engineering follows a structured workflow:

Understand the target system.
Map the attack surface.
Identify potential vulnerabilities.
Validate findings in authorized environments.
Automate security detection.
Implement appropriate mitigations.
Test, monitor, and continuously improve.

I believe effective cybersecurity is not just about discovering vulnerabilities. It is about understanding root causes and building resilient systems.

Current Focus
AI-powered cybersecurity solutions.
Secure AI application development.
Local LLM deployment and optimization.
Intelligent model routing.
Security automation and threat detection.
API and infrastructure security.
High-performance backend engineering.
Security monitoring and observability.
